\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\begin{bmatrix}\beta\\
\beta^{\dagger}
\end{bmatrix}=\begin{bmatrix}U^{\dagger} & V^{\dagger}\\
V^{\mathrm{T}} & U^{\mathrm{T}}
\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}c\\
c^{\dagger}
\end{bmatrix}=\mathcal{W}^{\dagger}\begin{bmatrix}c\\
c^{\dagger}
\end{bmatrix}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
这一变换由矩阵
\begin_inset Formula $\mathcal{W}$
\end_inset
表征：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\mathcal{W}=\begin{bmatrix}U & V^{*}\\
V & U^{*}
\end{bmatrix}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
现在系数
\begin_inset Formula $U$
\end_inset
和
\begin_inset Formula $V$
\end_inset
并不完全是任意的，
因为新算符
\begin_inset Formula $\beta_{k}$
\end_inset
，

\begin_inset Formula $\beta_{k}^{\dagger}$
\end_inset
需要满足和之前相同的费米对易关系。
这使得矩阵
\begin_inset Formula $\mathcal{W}$
\end_inset
必须是酉矩阵。

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\mathcal{W}^{\dagger}\mathcal{W}=1\quad\text{和}\quad\mathcal{W}\mathcal{W}^{\dagger}=1
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
或者可以写为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align}
U^{\dagger}U+V^{\dagger}V & =1\label{eq:orthogonality of UV}\\
UU^{\dagger}+V^{*}V^{\mathrm{T}} & =1\nonumber \\
U^{\mathrm{T}}V+V^{\mathrm{T}}U & =0\nonumber \\
UV^{\dagger}+V^{*}U^{\mathrm{T}} & =0\nonumber 
\end{align}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
这使得我们可以写出逆变换：

\begin_inset Formula 
\[
c_{l}^{\dagger}=\sum_{k}U_{lk}^{*}\beta_{k}^{\dagger}+V_{lk}\beta_{k}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Bloch和Messiah有一个著名的定理[Zu 62，
BM 62]，
它指出，
形式的（7.3）的酉矩阵总是可以分解为三个非常特殊形式的矩阵：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
\mathcal{W}=\begin{bmatrix}D & 0\\
0 & D^{*}
\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}\bar{U} & \bar{V}\\
\bar{V} & \bar{U}
\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}C & 0\\
0 & C^{*}
\end{bmatrix}\label{eq:decomposition of W}
\end{equation}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
或者写为：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
U & =D\bar{U}C\\
V & =D^{*}\bar{V}C
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
这里
\begin_inset Formula $D$
\end_inset
和
\begin_inset Formula $C$
\end_inset
是酉矩阵，

\begin_inset Formula $\bar{U}$
\end_inset
和
\begin_inset Formula $\bar{V}$
\end_inset
是具有如下形式的实矩阵：

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align}
\bar{U} & =\left[\begin{array}{rrrrrrr}
\ddots\\
 & 0 &  &  &  & 0\\
 &  & \begin{array}{cc}
\text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{u_{1}}}} & 0\\
0 & \text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{u_{1}}}}
\end{array}\\
 &  &  & \ddots\\
 &  &  &  & \begin{array}{cc}
\text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{u_{n}}}} & 0\\
0 & \text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{u_{n}}}}
\end{array}\\
 & 0 &  &  &  & 1\\
 &  &  &  &  &  & \ddots
\end{array}\right]\label{eq:form of UV}\\
\bar{V} & =\left[\begin{array}{rrrrrrr}
\ddots\\
 & 1 &  &  &  & 0\\
 &  & \begin{array}{cc}
0 & \text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{v_{1}}}}\\
\text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{-v_{1}}}} & 0
\end{array}\\
 &  &  & \ddots\\
 &  &  &  & \begin{array}{cc}
0 & \text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{v_{n}}}}\\
\text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{-v_{n}}}} & 0
\end{array}\\
 & 0 &  &  &  & 0\\
 &  &  &  &  &  & \ddots
\end{array}\right]\nonumber 
\end{align}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
然而使用下面这种形式的矩阵会使得证明更加简单，
也没有本质区别：

\end_layout

\begin_layout Booknote*
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\bar{V}=\left[\begin{array}{rrrrrrrr}
\ddots\\
 & 0 & \makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{1}} &  &  &  & 0\\
 & \makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{-1}} & \text{0}\\
 &  &  & \begin{array}{cc}
0 & \text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{v_{1}}}}\\
\text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{-v_{1}}}} & 0
\end{array}\\
 &  &  &  & \ddots\\
 &  &  &  &  & \begin{array}{cc}
0 & \text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{v_{n}}}}\\
\text{\makebox[0pt][]{\ensuremath{-v_{n}}}} & 0
\end{array}\\
 & 0 &  &  &  &  & 0\\
 &  &  &  &  &  &  & \ddots
\end{array}\right]
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
这个定理的证明在附录E.1中给出。
这个定理意味着这个变换可以分解成三个部分：

\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\begin{array}{ccc}
\left.\begin{array}{cc}
c & \rightarrow a\\
c^{\dagger} & \rightarrow a^{\dagger}
\end{array}\right\}  & \longrightarrow & \left\{ \begin{array}{cc}
\alpha & \rightarrow\beta\\
\alpha^{\dagger} & \rightarrow\beta^{\dagger}
\end{array}\right.\\
D & \bar{U},\bar{V} & C
\end{array}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
一个粒子算符
\begin_inset Formula $c^{\dagger}$
\end_inset
内部的酉变换，
